<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86772" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόβᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>property in cattle, abundance of cattle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κειμήλιά τε πρόβασίν τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					2.75
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προβατεία.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>advance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς π. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					7.1.5
				</span></i>
			; <i>progression</i> of musical sounds, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				26.120
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῶν χρόνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.110
				</span></i>
			: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοῦ νοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.595
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> bodily
				<i>growth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.114
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.373
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ προβάσεως,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ προσαγωγῆς</span>
			, Maria ap.Zos.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.158
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
